      "sourceTextSha256": "8afb723d3a3d6a4db441943ba6ef6714f6b4a7f377219f6a498db4c51be85f20",
      "text": "You’ll start early. After breakfast, there’s another activity in the reserve. You can spend a few more hours in the cloud forest before leaving and see it in the morning, when many birds and other wildlife are particularly active.\n\nAfter the activity, you’ll return to the lodge for lunch. Departure is at around 13:30.\n\nThe drive back takes you through the Andes towards Quito. You’re expected to reach your hotel in the city between about 16:00 and 17:00. The actual time depends on traffic, your hotel’s location and the number of passengers on the transfer.\n\nAfter several days in Quito, Cotopaxi and Mashpi, the island part of the trip begins. The next morning, you’ll fly to the Galápagos.\n\n**Accommodation:** Plaza Grande 5*, Royal Suite.  \n**Meals:** breakfast, lunch.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-e805e5042bc7",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      }
    },
